"siguiente actualización sin borrarlo."
msgstr ""
"What is on screen and what has been removed. “Remove” takes it off at the"
" next refresh without deleting it."

msgid ""
"Los mensajes del mural se publican solos, salvo lo que coincide con estas"
" palabras o reglas: eso queda pendiente para que decidas."
msgstr ""
"Wall messages are published automatically, except those that match these "
"words or rules: they are held for you to decide."

msgid ""
"Los mensajes y las reflexiones se publican solos, salvo lo que coincide "
"con estas palabras o reglas: eso queda pendiente para que decidas."
msgstr ""
"Messages and reflections are published automatically, except those that "
"match these words or rules: they are held for you to decide."

msgid "Mantener"
