msgid ""
"Mejor dejarlo apagado: una sola persona podría vaciar la pantalla "
"enviando avisos. Lo retirado así no se borra: espera a que decidas."
msgstr ""
"Best left off: a single person could empty the screen by sending reports."
" Anything removed this way is not deleted: it waits for your decision."

